{"ticker":"MASFIN","symbol":"MASFIN","instrumentId":3153240,"name":"Mas Financial Serv.","industry":"NSE-Finance-Consumer Loans","about":"MAS Financial Services Ltd. is a prominent non-banking financial company (NBFC) in India, specializing in providing financial services to micro-enterprises, small and medium enterprises (SMEs), and individual borrowers. The company offers a diverse range of products, including microfinance, SME loans, two-wheeler loans, and home loans, catering to both urban and rural customers. With a focus on financial inclusion, MAS Financial aims to empower underserved communities by offering accessible and affordable credit solutions. The company’s strong distribution network, advanced technology platform, and customer-centric approach ensure efficient loan processing and delivery, supporting economic growth and enhancing financial accessibility for its diverse clientele.","website":"www.mas.co.in","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:40:40.736Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":261.5,"changePct":-0.6043559238283382,"week52High":347.4,"week52Low":244.65},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹4,745 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹2,201 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"59,879,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"79"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"41,114,790"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.76%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.6"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.06"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.14"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"21%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"11.37"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"13–29"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"12.5%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-98.47"},{"label":"Volume","value":"42,803"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"157,544"},{"label":"Master score","value":"47"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"82"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"